  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.serveratelier.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.serveratelier.com/assets/themes/atelier/assets/images/banner/sa_budget.png\" alt=\"Получите свой бюджетный игровой сервер сегодня на ServerAtelier\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xR4YM0ND/Antique-Atlas-4-Compat/refs/heads/main/Gallery/antique_atlas_compat_title_wide.png\" alt=\"широкий заголовок совместимости с Antique Atlas 4\"></p>\n<p>Этот ресурспак добавляет поддержку модов для <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fantique-atlas-4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">antique atlas 4</a> &amp; различных модов на генерацию мира / структуры, перечисленных ниже.</p>\n<h2>Поддерживаемые моды:</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252flets-do-bloomingnature\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[Let's Do] BloomingNature</a> <code>// биомы</code></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fad-astra\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ad Astra</a> <code>// биомы</code></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fatmospheric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Atmospheric</a> <code>// биомы</code></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fautumnity\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Autumnity</a> <code>// биомы</code></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fblooming-biosphere\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Blooming Biosphere</a> <code>// биомы</code></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fclifftree\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cliff under a Tree (CliffTree)</a> <code>// биомы</code></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fenvironmental\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Environmental</a> <code>// биомы</code></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fnatures-spirit\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nature's Spirit</a> <code>// биомы + структуры + маркеры</code></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fspawn-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Spawn</a> <code>// биом</code></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fterralith\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Terralith</a> <code>// биомы</code></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fvanillabackport\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Vanilla Backport</a> <code>биом pale_oak</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Если вам нужна поддержка других модов, сообщите мне.<br>\nМой список задач доступен <a href=\"https://github.com/xR4YM0ND/Antique-Atlas-4-Compat/blob/main/TODO.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">здесь</a>.</p>\n<h2>Ссылки</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/xR4YM0ND/Antique-Atlas-4-Compat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">![Исходный код](<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fimg.shields.io%252fbadge%252fsource_code-lightgray%253fstyle%253dfor-the-badge%2526logo%253dgithub%2526label%253d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://img.shields.io/badge/source_code-lightgray?style=for-the-badge&logo=github&label=</a> &labelColor=555555) </a>![Discord](<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fimg.shields.io%252fdiscord%252f745451299713056791%253fstyle%253dfor-the-badge%2526logo%253ddiscord%2526logoColor%253dwhite%2526label%253d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://img.shields.io/discord/745451299713056791?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white&label=</a> &labelColor=555555&amp;color=5865F2)\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fantique-atlas-4-compat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">![Загрузки Modrinth](<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fimg.shields.io%252fmodrinth%252fdt%252fEZrcB8Mu%253fstyle%253dfor-the-badge%2526logo%253dmodrinth%2526logoColor%253dwhite%2526label%253d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/EZrcB8Mu?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&logoColor=white&label=</a> &labelColor=555555&amp;color=1BD964) </a>![Загрузки CurseForge](<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fimg.shields.io%252fcurseforge%252fdt%252f1219627%253fstyle%253dfor-the-badge%2526logo%253dcurseforge%2526logoColor%253dwhite%2526label%253d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1219627?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white&label=</a> &labelColor=555555&amp;color=FF8041)</p>",
